{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39983","headline":"岳州端午日送人游郴连 · 徐夤","name":"岳州端午日送人游郴连","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"五月巴陵值积阴，送君千里客于郴。\n北风吹雨黄梅落，西日过湖青草深。\n竞渡岸傍人挂锦，采芳城上女遗簪。\n九嶷云阔苍梧暗，与说重华旧德音。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39983.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39983","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}